            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10.2.3 Photosynthesis: in a nutshell"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.494,
            0.135,
            0.884,
            0.36
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We know that water, sunlight, carbon dioxide from the air, and chlorophyll are necessary to carry out the process of photosynthesis that produces carbohydrates (Fig. 10.5). During photosynthesis, food is actually produced in the form of glucose, a simple carbohydrate. This glucose not only serves as an instant source of energy but also later gets converted into starch for storage. The word equation of photosynthesis is given below —"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.304,
            0.397,
            0.834,
            0.454
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_9_equation_5.jpg",
          "content": "\\mathrm{Carohoniide+Wafter\\xrightarrow{Sunlight}Gluccesso}\\ \\mathrm{Gluccesso}\\ \\mathrm{Gxygen}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.48,
            0.342,
            0.5
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "KNOW A SCIENTIST"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.504,
            0.749,
            0.54
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Many scientists across the world contributed to develop an understanding of photosynthesis. In India, Rustom Hormusji Dastur"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.544,
            0.253,
            0.669
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.109,
